      <title>Cultivating Faculty: Mentorship Across the Academic Journey — Program Launch at Childers Hall (Chadwick A. Boseman College of Fine Arts)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54063227445853/huge/81104914c3f4eb334733e3655fdc745fa2c384f3.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 05 Oct 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>The Chadwick A. Boseman College of Fine Arts invites the Howard University community to the launch of its 2026–2027 Faculty Development Series, Cultivating Faculty: Mentorship Across the Academic Journey.
<br> </p>

<p>Featuring Dr. Dana A. Williams, Dean of the Graduate School at Howard University, this opening conversation will explore mentorship beyond the traditional one-to-one model, considering the networks of mentors, peers, collaborators, and sponsors who help support professional growth.
<br> </p>

<p>The program launches CABCoFA’s yearlong, College-wide faculty mentorship initiative, which will bring faculty together throughout the academic year for sustained conversation, peer exchange, and professional development around research and scholarship, creative practice, teaching, tenure and promotion, academic leadership, and faculty career development.
<br> </p>

<p>Monday, October 5, 2026 | 12:00–1:00 p.m.
<br>Recital Hall, College of Fine Arts, Room 300
<br> </p>

<p>Open to the wider Howard University community.</p>

<p><a href="https://events.howard.edu/event/cultivating-faculty-mentorship-across-the-academic-journey-program-launch">View on site</a> | <a href="mailto:?subject=I found an interesting event%3A Cultivating Faculty%3A Mentorship Across the Academic Journey %E2%80%94 Program Launch&amp;body=I found an interesting event you may like%3A%0A%0A%0ADate%3A Oct 5%2C 2026%0A%0ADescription%3A%0AThe Chadwick A. Boseman College of Fine Arts invites the Howard University community to the launch of its 2026%E2%80%932027 Faculty Development Series%2C Cultivating Faculty%3A Mentorship Across the Academic Journey.%0A %0A%0AFeaturing Dr. Dana A. Williams%2C Dean of the Graduate School at Howard University%2C this opening conversation will explore mentorship beyond the traditional one-to-one model%2C considering the networks of mentors%2C peers%2C collaborators%2C and sponsors who help support professional growth.%0A %0A%0AThe program launches CABCoFA%E2%80%99s yearlong%2C College-wide faculty mentorship initiative%2C which will bring faculty together throughout the academic year for sustained conversation%2C peer exchange%2C and professional development around research and scholarship%2C creative practice%2C teaching%2C tenure and promotion%2C academic leadership%2C and faculty career development.%0A %0A%0AMonday%2C October 5%2C 2026 %7C 12%3A00%E2%80%931%3A00 p.m.%0ARecital Hall%2C College of Fine Arts%2C Room 300%0A %0A%0AOpen to the wider Howard University community.%0A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fevents.howard.edu%2Fevent%2Fcultivating-faculty-mentorship-across-the-academic-journey-program-launch%0A">Email this event</a></p></div></div>]]></description>
