      <title>DCSBDC-MWBG Small Business Expo at Blackburn Center (Armour J. Blackburn University Center)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54071885701260/huge/85151ad285d62069ce14b9433efd3e1c82b174ee.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Wed, 07 Oct 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Join the DC Small Business Development Center (DCSBDC) for the DCSBDC-MWBG Small Business Expo on Wednesday, October 7.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>This exciting event will bring together small business owners, entrepreneurs, students, and business professionals for a day of learning, networking, and connecting with valuable resources. Attendees will have the opportunity to participate in small business workshops, meet professionals from the business community,banks, explore resources available to entrepreneurs and connect with local business owners.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Registration is required to attend.</p>

<p>Register at <a href="http://www.dcsbdc.org">www.dcsbdc.org</a> or contact Yahaira Hurtado at <a href="mailto:Yahaira.Hurtado@Howard.edu">Yahaira.Hurtado@Howard.edu</a> for additional information. </p>

<p>Date: Wednesday, October 7, 2026
<br>Time: 8:00 a.m.–4:00 p.m.
<br>Location: Blackburn Center, Howard University</p>

